Short: Vic-20 revival demo by AR89. (for the Vic-20 unexp)
Type: demo/euro
Uploader: tlr@stacken.kth.se
Author: tlr@stacken.kth.se & pawal@proxxi.uf.se

One day, while disposing 3 refrigerators, we found an old Vic-20
lying at the junkyard.   Fascinating!  Is it possible to make
a demo on an unexpanded Vic-20?    We consulted some friends and
got some documentation.   After coding one whole day, it actually
works!   Everything was made using "DATA" statements. 

We will probably make a more interesting demo later this summer,
when I (T.L.R) has made a interface between the Amiga and the Vic.


* Awaken the dead!  Resuscitate!  Resurrect!
* Vic-20, 3.5KB and rising...

